OL,3,ADeadly fire at Canada military base
OL,4,Amoved a kilometre 'in 30 to 60 seconds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire that killed four members of
OL,7,Fthe Canadian military and injured
OL,8,Fdozens of others on Saturday spread
OL,9,Fwith alarming speed, accounts suggest.
OL,11,FIt broke out in a grassy training area
OL,12,Fat a base in the province of Alberta
OL,13,Fand spread rapidly due to strong winds.
OL,15,F"The fire was 1km (0.6 miles) away when
OL,16,Fthe wind shifted," said Maj-Gen Wade
OL,17,FRutland, commander of the 1st Canadian
OL,18,FDivision of the Canadian Armed Forces.
OL,19,F"It is not normal for a fire to move a
OL,20,Fkilometre in 30 to 60 seconds."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
