OL,3,ADeadly fire at Canada military base
OL,4,Amoved a kilometre 'in 30 to 60 seconds'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney described it
OL,7,Fas "one of the worst tragedies for the
OL,8,Fforces on Canadian soil in peacetime".
OL,9,FOfficials have ruled out the
OL,10,Fpossibility of "any terrorist
OL,11,Factivity".
